      "what": "Only wheat has a sowing-time series; canola's Early series is a maturity group with no usable pairs.",
      "consequence": "Effects are given by region and by variety, never by crop.",
      "file": "studies/C2/plan_C2_v1.2_addendum.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "Wheat trials hold rows under names that have yields only in canola trials.",
      "consequence": "None enters the analysis, and observed flowering dates cannot be used.",
      "file": "studies/C2/report_C2_v2.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "Pairs within 5 km were narrowed to pairs on the same paddock.",
      "consequence": "The average effect compares 205 same-paddock pairs, not the 225 pairs of the first stage.",
      "file": "studies/C2/plan_C2_v1.3_addendum.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "The analysis plan was run first on a table with Early and Main swapped at random in each pair, then frozen.",
      "consequence": "The plan hash was fixed before the true table was read.",
      "file": "studies/C2/plan_C2_v1.2_addendum.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "The APSIM launcher lost runs without an error: 15 of the first 50 pairs abstained.",
      "consequence": "The launcher now records exit codes and reruns failed batches; the 15 pairs were rerun.",
      "file": "studies/C2/plan_C2_v1.2_addendum.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "The balance test of Early against Main trials before sowing was missing from the v1.2 plan.",
      "consequence": "kernR's test was added and found no difference before sowing.",
      "file": "studies/C2/plan_C2_v1.3_addendum.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "Applied nitrogen included in-crop top-dressing, which can respond to sowing date.",
      "consequence": "Only nitrogen applied by sowing day enters the proxymix lens and the balance test.",
      "file": "studies/C2/plan_C2_v1.6a_addendum.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "The first value used the 2026-27 forecast wheat price for seasons 2008 to 2017.",
      "consequence": "The value is priced at the study seasons' ABARES prices.",
      "file": "studies/C2/plan_C2_v1.4_addendum.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "Some same-paddock pairs lost a trial's yields.",
      "consequence": "The lost pairs are counted by which series lost yields.",
      "file": "studies/C2/plan_C2_v1.5_addendum.md"
    },
    {
      "what": "masque's conditional clone of a long table, with sowing window as treatment, dropped the pair from its conditioning.",
      "consequence": "The clone was built from the wide table, Early and Main yields as two outcomes, which keeps each pair's means.",
      "file": "E1/NOTES.md"
    }
  ],
